 494               /       ALL FILE TYPES AND ALL FILE NAMES ARE ELEGIBLE TO BE COPIED. NO FILE WRITE
 495               /       VERIFICATION WILL BE PERFORMED, SO THERE ARE NO "[OK]" MESSAGES TO CONFIRM
 496               /       THE CORRECT FILE CONTENTS. SINCE /S WAS INVOKED, THE PROGRAM EXITS TO THE
 497               /       MONITOR AFTER ONE OPERATION.
