 842               
 843               /       ALL RUNNING CODE IS INTIALLY LOADED 2600 HIGHER THAN ASSEMBLED TO ALLOW
 844               /       FILMAN TO PROCESS THE KEYBOARD MONITOR COMMAND BUFFER. THE ONCE-ONLY CODE
 845               /       IS LOADED INTO ABSOLUTE ADDRESS SPACE. THE ONCE-ONLY CODE MODIFIES AND
 846               /       RELOCATES THE RUNNING CODE AS NECESSARY. IF RESPONSE MODE OPERATIONS ARE
 847               /       NEEDED SUBSEQUENTLY, A PORTION OF THE PROGRAM WILL BE SWAPPED INTO ABSOLUTE
 848               /       ADDRESS SPACE AS REQUIRED.
