2112 002162* 4560          JMS I   [P7CH]          /PRINT IT
2113 002163* 1373          TAD     (":&177)        /GET A ":"
2114 002164* 4560          JMS I   [P7CH]          /PRINT IT
2115 002165* 5754          JMP I   UNITPRT         /RETURN
